  "label": "Islamophobia",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references Islamophobia by using the visual of a man with a beard and head covering (commonly associated with Muslim men) to represent 'most religions' in a context that may be perceived as dismissive of religious extremism or violence. This visual choice can reinforce harmful stereotypes that associate Islam with terrorism or violence, even though the text claims 'most religions are religions of peace'. The background knowledge of Islamophobia is necessary to understand the potential harmful intent or the stereotype being reinforced.",
